{"turns": [
  {
    "speaker": "agent",
    "text": "Thank you for calling Nimbus Telecom, my name is Sana. How can I help you today?",
    "tags": ["greeting"]
  },
  {
    "speaker": "customer",
    "text": "Hi Sana, I'm Sneha Patel. My phone has been acting up for the last few days and I can't get any signal on it.",
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "speaker": "agent",
    "text": "I am sorry to hear that you are experiencing signal issues with your device, Ms. Patel. I know how frustrating it is to be disconnected.",
    "tags": ["empathy"]
  },
  {
    "speaker": "customer",
    "text": "It's incredibly annoying. I've tried restarting it and resetting the network settings, but nothing works. I just want it fixed now.",
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "speaker": "agent",
    "text": "Let me check the line. It seems the SIM card might be faulty. I can send you a replacement SIM to your address on file.",
    "tags": ["action:device_fix"]
  },
  {
    "speaker": "customer",
    "text": "A replacement SIM? I don't have time to wait for the mail. I need my phone working right now. This is ridiculous.",
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "speaker": "agent",
    "text": "I understand, but a replacement SIM is the standard procedure for this specific error. I can't fix it remotely from here.",
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "speaker": "customer",
    "text": "This is a joke. I've been a customer for years and you're just telling me to wait for a few days? I'm getting more and more angry about this.",
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "speaker": "agent",
    "text": "I apologize for the inconvenience. While I can't speed up the delivery, I can help you pay your outstanding balance to ensure the service remains active.",
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "speaker": "customer",
    "text": "Fine, just take the payment. My number is 98828 72121 and the card is four four six six zero zero one six six five nine four one three four seven.",
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "speaker": "agent",
    "text": "Thank you. The payment has been processed successfully.",
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "speaker": "customer",
    "text": "That doesn't change the fact that my phone is useless. I'm absolutely dissatisfied with this service.",
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "speaker": "agent",
    "text": "I understand your frustration. Is there anything else I can assist you with today? I'll have that replacement SIM sent out immediately, and you can activate it once it arrives.",
    "tags": ["closure"]
  },
  {
    "speaker": "customer",
    "text": "No, there is nothing else. This is a disaster.",
    "tags": []
  }
]}
